---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-8">About</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-zinc dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
      <p>I am a physicist by training and a programmer by heart. I have a lot of interest in diverse fields, from physics and astronomy, which I studied as an undergraduate for two years, to artificial intelligence, programming, science fiction, photography and music.</p>
      <p>I created this website to talk about the things I like, which includes all of above subjects and a little more. But more than a blog, it is also a hub for any projects I come to conceive.</p>
      <p>If you want more: <a href="http://about.me/allanino">about.me/allanino</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
